  "question": "What fast food restaurant can I find within 10 kilometers in the forward direction toward Oaks of Country Club - Pool House, Rockledge, FL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.377183 28.52499)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.754783 28.334668)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.377183 28.52499)',4326)::geography, 10000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.377183 28.52499)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
